{"duration_api_ms":100537,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b7167202-a60b-4fb2-91a9-588534f18c00","total_cost_usd":0.17527199999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16732,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":10834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6388},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16732,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10834,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16732},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10834,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16732,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.17527199999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":6388,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is a one-parameter curve: D=3.3852 (pinned by mass fraction, margin 1.5e-5), b=1.2 and cone=70 are all at their limits, and only gamma varies. Flux rises from 227k to 274.6k W/m2 and bondline T falls from 417.9 K to 391.1 K as gamma steepens from -1.5 to -3.5703, where max_g reaches 12. Moving off the corner has not paid: lower b or cone violates mass fraction (C-8efdd90862a0, C-099cae65259a, C-26610a6c01d5), smaller D raises flux and T (C-114b79b08144), and b>1.2 fails on geometry or surrogate extrapolation (C-f986776067bd, C-de929f2046c9, C-207a027e9dd5, C-4d9cd4c2b38d). The only remaining hypervolume is in the gaps of the gamma sweep, so all 20 proposals change gamma only.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-ee7fb6bb3da7 (gamma -3.5703): g=12.0 with margin 1.1e-5, so the steep end is saturated.\",\"C-5f4e033c35a8 (gamma -1.55) and C-895ab2d00f94 (gamma -1.5): the shallow end is at the gamma bound.\",\"Mass-fraction margin is 1.496e-5 for every D=3.3852 row regardless of gamma, so a gamma-only change keeps the parent's D and mass-fraction margin.\",\"Gaps in the gamma sweep: -2.46 to -2.64, -2.64 to -2.84, -2.15 to -2.29, -1.85 to -1.99, -2.9 to -3.05 and -3.26 to -3.38.\",\"C-114b79b08144 (D=3.2, gamma -3.7) is worse in T at a given g and infeasible on g, so trading D for steeper gamma does not help.\",\"Front spacing is roughly linear in gamma: about 24k W/m2 per deg in flux and about -10 K per deg in T, so linear interpolation gives good predictions.\"],\"mechanism\":\"The two objectives trade off along gamma through the entry pulse: a steeper entry gives a higher peak flux and a shorter, lower-load pulse, so bondline T is lower. Peak g is set almost entirely by gamma (about 1.67 g/deg) and caps gamma near -3.5703. D, b and cone sit at their bounds, so they minimise flux and T together. The remaining hypervolume comes from filling gaps in the front with midpoints, weighted toward the largest gaps. This relies on the data plus standard stagnation-heating and ballistic-coefficient scaling.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Expected gains are tiny, at most about 1e-4 in normalised hypervolume, because the front is already dense. Interpolated flux and T should be accurate to about 0.2 K and about 300 W/m2. The -3.57035 point sits about 5e-5 deg beyond the last feasible point, so its g margin is nearly zero and it could fail. I cannot exclude some of these gammas having been evaluated in unseen rows, though I used three-decimal values ending in 5 to reduce that risk.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-28f1ab046e52\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -1.65 to -1.74 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.705},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231285,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.52,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the shallow part of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8db3e4b49981\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -1.74 to -1.85 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.795},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233160,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e187d3d3634a\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -1.85 to -1.99 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.905},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235510,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.42,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills one of the wider gaps in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-909670dec030\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -1.85 to -1.99 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.945},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":236380,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.81,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the same wide gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-909670dec030\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -1.99 to -2.08 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.045},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238570,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.32,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-7b560ea882d2\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -2.08 to -2.15 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.115},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240125,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-32c30b4995e0\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -2.15 to -2.29 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.205},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242165,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.02,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a wide gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-cee9688f613e\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -2.15 to -2.29 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.245},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243075,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.47,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the same wide gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a96d48da9cb1\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -2.29 to -2.40 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.355},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":245600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.96,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-aae834d393ca\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -2.46 to -2.64 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.515},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249340,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.86,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a wide gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3f86618a8e42\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -2.46 to -2.64 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.575},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":250750,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.09,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the same wide gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3f86618a8e42\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -2.64 to -2.84 gap, the widest gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.715},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254060,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the widest gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-1ec878a1158c\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -2.64 to -2.84 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.775},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":255480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.63,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the widest gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d24d4621fa68\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -2.90 to -3.05 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.955},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259770,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.52,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a wide gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b7979f8d5d1a\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -2.90 to -3.05 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.005},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260980,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.96,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the same wide gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b0765bf1732d\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of the -3.16 to -3.26 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.215},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266025,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.67,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b0765bf1732d\",\"rationale\":\"First third of the -3.26 to -3.38 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.305},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268190,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.73,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a wide gap near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ee4f7c092799\",\"rationale\":\"Second third of the -3.26 to -3.38 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.345},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269010,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.32,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the same wide gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8ddd54810aa3\",\"rationale\":\"Point between the -3.44 and -3.49 evaluations.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.475},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272270,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.01,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a small gap in the steep part of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ee7fb6bb3da7\",\"rationale\":\"A tiny step past the current g=12 endpoint. The g slack is about 1.4e-4 g, or about 8e-5 deg of gamma, which is more than the 5e-5 deg step.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57035},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274572,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the steep end of the front by about 0.01 K. It may violate max_g if the g slope is steeper than I estimated.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":67843,"type":"result","duration_ms":100585,"uuid":"d892550f-e3cb-4b65-9c0a-d3ae2a9424d4","ttft_stream_ms":1551,"time_to_request_ms":47,"first_content_frame_ms":1552,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
